FPCNetPatch v1.1 by PMK - (15-Jan-95) - This
patch fixes a bug in the translation tables.
The IBM GFX mode translates the upper 32
chars (224-255) into duplicates of some of
the other chars. This makes ANSI GFX look
like SH*T. This patch puts the original
chars (224-225) back where they belong. -
Now also includes PatchBBS & ZoneGateFix!!
